                <i class="fa-solid fa-plug" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                <h4 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Colokan Listrik</h4>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">Bali menggunakan colokan dua-pin Tipe C dan F gaya Eropa (230V).</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-hands-praying" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                <h4 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Menghormati Budaya</h4>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">Tutupi bahu dan lutut di pura. Sarung biasanya wajib dan disediakan.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    {% endraw %}{% include "partials/testimonials.njk" %}{% raw %}
    <section class="booking-section" id="book-now">
        <h2 class="section-title">Pesan Petualangan Anda</h2>
        <div class="booking-container reveal">
            <form class="booking-form" name="booking" action="/" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
                <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="booking">
                <p style="display:none;"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="name">Nama Lengkap</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Masukkan nama lengkap Anda" autocomplete="name" autocapitalize="words" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="whatsapp">Nomor WhatsApp</label>
                        <input type="tel" id="whatsapp" name="whatsapp" placeholder="+62..." autocomplete="tel" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="package">Pilih Paket Tur</label>
                        <select id="package" name="package" required>
                            <option value="" disabled selected>Pilih tur...</option>
                            <option value="West Nusa Penida">Tur Nusa Penida Barat</option>
                            <option value="East Nusa Penida">Tur Nusa Penida Timur</option>
                            <option value="Nusa Penida Snorkeling">Snorkeling Nusa Penida</option>
                            <option value="Uluwatu Full Day">Tur Sehari Penuh Uluwatu</option>
                            <option value="Sekumpul Waterfall">Tur Air Terjun Sekumpul</option>
                            <option value="North Bali Canyoning">Canyoning Bali Utara</option>
                            <option value="Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking">Trekking Matahari Terbit Gunung Batur</option>
                            <option value="Private Transport (Custom Tour)">Transportasi Pribadi (Tur Khusus)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="date">Tanggal Perjalanan</label>
                        <input type="date" id="date" name="date" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="pax">Jumlah Orang</label>
                        <input type="number" id="pax" name="pax" min="1" placeholder="Berapa orang?" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="message">Permintaan Khusus / Catatan</label>
                    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Ada kebutuhan diet atau lokasi penjemputan tertentu?" autocapitalize="sentences"></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn submit-btn">Minta Pemesanan</button>
                <div id="booking-confirmation" style="display:none; margin-top:16px; padding:14px 18px; background:#e8f5e9; border:1px solid #4CAF50; border-radius:8px; color:#2e7d32; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.5;"></div>
                <div class="payment-trust-badge" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
                    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Setelah Anda mengirim, kami akan mengonfirmasi ketersediaan melalui WhatsApp dan mengirimkan detail pembayaran — tautan PayPal aman untuk kartu internasional, atau transfer bank untuk tamu lokal.</p>
                    <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px;">
                        <i class="fa-brands fa-cc-paypal" title="PayPal" style="color: #00457c; transition: transform 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'"></i>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns" title="Bank Transfer" style="color: #4CAF50; transition: transform 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>
{% endraw %}{% endblock %}
